<title>USA: Fed's overnight system RPs total $6.0 billion.</title>
<headline>Fed's overnight system RPs total $6.0 billion.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve's injection of overnight system repurchase agreements on Wednesday totalled $6.0 billion, a New York Fed spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Analysts had figured the Fed's operation would be $3.0 billion for the final day of the reserve period.</p>
<p>Tuesday, the Fed's overnight system RP operation was $1.015 billion.</p>
<p>-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1867</p>
</text>
